  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-rendering step 16 goes through all docs, delivering resize observer notifications and updating style and layout.\n\nStep 17 fixes up the focus if there's a layout change that causes something to be not focusable or so. I don't see a reason why that needs to be a separate phase? Any reason it shouldn't be done after the loop of step 16?",
